%%{ init: { 'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#232F3E', 'primaryTextColor': '#fff', 'lineColor': '#FF9900' } } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Human as Engineer<br/>(Jira UI)
    participant Jira as Jira Cloud
    participant APIGW as API Gateway<br/>(/prod/webhook)
    participant WH as Webhook Receiver<br/>(Lambda)
    participant SM as Secrets Manager
    participant DDB as DynamoDB<br/>(Dedupe Table)
    participant Agent as DevOps Agent<br/>(Event Channel)
    participant MCP as Jira MCP Server
    participant Audit as CloudWatch<br/>Audit Log

    Note over Human, Agent: TRIGGER PATH — Bug created in Jira → Autonomous Agent Investigation

    Human->>+Jira: Create Bug: "Payment 503s for APAC"<br/>Project: KAN, Priority: High
    Jira->>Jira: Fire configured webhook

    Jira->>+APIGW: POST /prod/webhook<br/>X-Hub-Signature: sha256=<hmac><br/>Body: {webhookEvent, issue, user, ...}
    APIGW->>+WH: Invoke Lambda

    %% HMAC verification
    WH->>+SM: get_secret_value(JiraWebhookSecretArn)
    SM-->>-WH: {secret: "..."}
    WH->>WH: HMAC-SHA256 verify<br/>(constant-time compare)

    %% Self-loop guardrail
    WH->>WH: _is_agent_authored(payload)?
    Note right of WH: Check user.accountId<br/>∉ JIRA_AGENT_ACCOUNT_IDS<br/>and comment body<br/>doesn't start with "[Agent]"
    WH->>WH: Result: false (human-authored)

    %% Normalize
    WH->>WH: _normalize(payload)
    Note right of WH: Maps Jira event →<br/>Agent event schema:<br/>{eventType, incidentId,<br/> priority, title, service,<br/> data.metadata.source="jira",<br/> data.metadata.issue_key="KAN-6"}

    %% Filter
    WH->>WH: _filter_match(event)?
    Note right of WH: Evaluates JIRA_WEBHOOK_FILTER<br/>(e.g. "project=KAN AND<br/>priority in (P1,P2,High,Highest)")
    WH->>WH: Result: true (matches)

    %% Dedupe
    WH->>+DDB: put_item(dedupe_key, expires_at)<br/>ConditionExpression: attribute_not_exists
    DDB-->>-WH: Success (first time seen)

    %% Forward to agent
    WH->>+SM: get_secret_value(AgentWebhookSecretArn)
    SM-->>-WH: {secret: "..."}
    WH->>WH: Sign: HMAC-SHA256(timestamp:payload)

    WH->>+Agent: POST https://event-ai.../webhook/generic/...<br/>x-amzn-event-timestamp: ...<br/>x-amzn-event-signature: ...<br/>Body: normalized event
    Agent-->>-WH: 200 OK (accepted)

    WH->>Audit: [AUDIT] {event:"forwarded", issue_key:"KAN-6", priority:"HIGH"}
    WH-->>-APIGW: 200 {status: "forwarded"}
    APIGW-->>-Jira: 200

    Note over Agent: Agent picks up event,<br/>loads jira-bug-triage-writeback skill,<br/>begins autonomous investigation

    %% Agent investigation and write-back
    Agent->>Agent: Investigate using CW, X-Ray,<br/>Grafana, GitHub, custom MCP...

    Agent->>+MCP: tools/call: add_comment<br/>{issue_key:"KAN-6", body:"[Agent] Investigation..."}
    MCP->>MCP: Redact → Policy → Jira call
    MCP->>+Jira: POST /issue/KAN-6/comment
    Jira-->>-MCP: 201 Created
    MCP-->>-Agent: {status:"added", comment_id:"10043"}

    Note over Jira, WH: Jira fires webhook for agent's comment...

    Jira->>+APIGW: POST /prod/webhook (comment_created)
    APIGW->>+WH: Invoke Lambda
    WH->>WH: HMAC verify → OK
    WH->>WH: _is_agent_authored()?
    Note right of WH: comment.author.accountId<br/>∈ JIRA_AGENT_ACCOUNT_IDS<br/>OR body starts with "[Agent]"
    WH->>WH: Result: TRUE → DROP
    WH->>Audit: [AUDIT] {event:"self_loop_drop", issue_key:"KAN-6"}
    WH-->>-APIGW: 200 {status: "self-loop dropped"}
    APIGW-->>-Jira: 200

    Note over Human: Engineer wakes up to a fully<br/>triaged ticket with RCA comment.<br/>No re-trigger loop. No duplicates.
